status: credential-entry-required
schema: @deepseek-ai/dsh-credentials-local version 1, refs section, mode 0600
  OPENCODE_GO_API_KEY      opencode-go  official
  DEEPSEEK_API_KEY         deepseek     official
  OPENROUTER_API_KEY       openrouter   official
  XAI_API_KEY              grok-xai     official
  CURSOR_API_KEY           cursor       UNOFFICIAL (not prompted: off by default)
owner act: dsh-fleet first-run --credentials
  interactive terminal only; fields: OPENCODE_GO_API_KEY, DEEPSEEK_API_KEY, OPENROUTER_API_KEY, XAI_API_KEY, CURSOR_API_KEY
  or open the fleet web UI -> Models and add the same provider fields as the fleet user (native DSH path: <DSH_HOME>/.credentials.yaml, refs section, mode 0600)
  optional, off by default: CURSOR_API_KEY (unofficial; pass --include-unofficial to enter it)
  a non-interactive run never reads stdin and never writes a credential value
